<title>USA: Citicorp sets $300 mln in capital securities.</title>
<headline>Citicorp sets $300 mln in capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of capital securities, a trust preferred issue, from Citicorp was priced on Tuesday, according to co-manager Citicorp Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc was lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER CITICORP</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	  COUPON 7.933 PCT  MATURITY 2/15/2027</p>
<p>TYPE CAP SECURITIES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE NA LAST MOODY'S A1     YIELD 7.933 PCT   PAY FREQ NA</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS    SPREAD 120 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL 10</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
